{"authority_effect":"NONE","reviewer":null,"schema_version":1,"scope":"NINE_AGENT_CORRECTIONS_AND_THREE_CAO_GAPS","sources":[{"bibliography":{"citation":"北京市文物局《寺院土地田产的经营方式（中）》所录“乾隆三十九年僧宗玉立租房契”","url":"https://wwj.beijing.gov.cn/bjww/wwjzzcslm/1731063/1731066/djs/1731072/1731538/index.html"},"carrier_capture":{"ref":"asset:sha256:fa65f0a770344fc760af3411b5fa3a4665d83c73496664f980a4f9ee8191da76","sha256":"fa65f0a770344fc760af3411b5fa3a4665d83c73496664f980a4f9ee8191da76"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc","sha256":"15da766c875fee0cc85ffda56f6b5aca9a70960fed444886a7f781d63e6777cc"},"excerpt_revision":{"previous_source_sha256":"fb2845103abef44f85900f24c064d3139ae138b63837902f9f68727aaf817235","ref":"asset:sha256:e3ea7331438e7a53d594f62d583d07f31ccb0cb26555ce6ec7732f23b5bd883c","sha256":"e3ea7331438e7a53d594f62d583d07f31ccb0cb26555ce6ec7732f23b5bd883c"},"id":"src:history:beijing:1774:rental-contract","legacy_locator":{"contract":"乾隆三十九年僧宗玉立租房契","region":"今北京昌平一带"},"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:e0953b78c0d81651b56b799c02495d66c4dc5429578cffc85569b259e53e86f4","joiner":"","kind":"HTML_TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"44977b3557cf6ec3d400a1311f98bf03ac97b4331cd00f0293511a7c5380110d","raw_text_sha256":"2d55220e01fcfc97b08f161106190e4fde784050856539382f3b65ab96e6e8b4","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":3879,"start":3760,"unit_ref":"html:1"}]},"locator_verification":{"reason":"Revised raw excerpt verified; correction and claim impact are recorded separately.","report_ref":"asset:sha256:0c8ec665775e1c204cc9dea444ffdec534d29cd4e4bb328efed5bf52ffc5f9b6","report_sha256":"0c8ec665775e1c204cc9dea444ffdec534d29cd4e4bb328efed5bf52ffc5f9b6","source_record_sha256":"d75e42caf94a7e3018466178aa019c7cd6dfef5d8c7a5b8aaacb7737d5426ec0","status":"VERIFIED"},"notes":"证明乾隆北京地区存在正式房屋租契与租价约定；该契为铺面房，不能证明贾家具体住宅院落或租价。","text":"立租契人系瑞应寺下院当家宗玉，今有二拔子庙上铺面房屋一所，共计十六间，今租沙河德春店作理生意，连借缸三口。对众言定每年租价清钱五十千正，只许客辞主，不许主辞客。房屋损坏，房主修理。恐后无凭，立租帖存照。现收